  "pre_gate_answer": "# Briefing: Gap in Evidence on the DDQ Update\n\n## Conclusion\nThe provided evidence is **insufficient** to answer the question about the 2021 covering note.\n\n## What the evidence does confirm\n- **ILPA** is the relevant organization linked to the responsible-investment / ESG due diligence questionnaire.\n- An ILPA document titled **“ESG Assessment Framework – Key Considerations & FAQ”** states that the framework **“was first released in 2021.”**\n- That framework can be used alongside **ILPA’s Due Diligence Questionnaire**.\n\n## What the evidence does *not* provide\nThe supplied documents do **not** state:\n- **when the first version** of the responsible-investment due diligence questionnaire was launched;\n- **who adopted** that first version;\n- **when the working group** for the update was set up; or\n- **how long LPs and GPs** had been providing comments.\n\n## Assessment\nBased strictly on the retrieved evidence, the exact answer is **not available in the supplied documents**.",
